re we all appreciate it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12981-romulusgloriosus","name":"RomulusGloriosus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"342"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T03:18:32-07:00","id":1078252,"title":"","content":"Legally, it's unlikely David Hill has a case. He did leave on his own, and WWP has the right to hire whoever it wants, even if that person allegedly stalked someone else affiliated with the company. It may not be the wisest move from a liability standpoint, but they do have the right to do that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Our society is held together by the thinnest of threads: that exquisitely refined sense of tribal order.<br /> Edith Wharton, The Age of Innocence<br /> <br /> I am a huge fan of both the Trinity Universe and the classic World of Darkness.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12799-spellfire22","name":"Spellfire22","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T06:58:42-07:00","id":1078315,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spellfire22</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1077105-i-m-done?p=1078252#post1078252\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Legally, it's unlikely David Hill has a case. He did leave on his own, and WWP has the right to hire whoever it wants, even if that person allegedly stalked someone else affiliated with the company. It may not be the wisest move from a liability standpoint, but they do have the right to do that.</div> </div> </div> </div>A case for what?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T11:24:22-07:00","id":1078433,"title":"","content":"To sue Onyx Path and/or White Wolf under a hostile work environment theory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Our society is held together by the thinnest of threads: that exquisitely refined sense of tribal order.<br /> Edith Wharton, The Age of Innocence<br /> <br /> I am a huge fan of both the Trinity Universe and the classic World of Darkness.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12799-spellfire22","name":"Spellfire22","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T12:27:53-07:00","id":1078470,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spellfire22</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1077105-i-m-done?p=1078433#post1078433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To sue Onyx Path and/or White Wolf under a hostile work environment theory.</div> </div> </div> </div>Who said he had any intent to do that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T12:43:53-07:00","id":1078480,"title":"","content":"If I understand correctly, David is just bitter and feels betrayed because he reads Rose's post as a lie that he wasn't the one developing the game for the past few months, so he is currently &quot;paying the favor back&quot; by saying whatever he feels is appropriate to say on social media.<br /> Honestly, I feel weird, because I never read that post in the way he did and had to stare at it for like 30 minutes before going &quot;oh, so he read it like this, huh&quot; while having his words for context, so it might be a gigantic miscommunication and overreaction.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1060128-david-hill-has-left-opp-what-happens-to-changeling-now-changeling-is-still-happening?p=1060155#post1060155\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>Changeling </i>has a new dev team, who have been working on the core and the line for months now. I'm leading that team. I'm sorry that David's no longer involved, but <i>Changeling</i> is still happening.<br /> <br /> I'll try and get some new open dev up soon. Probably Goblin Contracts and the related concept of Goblin Debt, since I'm really happy with the current draft of them.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Post in question.<br /> David read it as a lie that he wasn't working on the Changeling 2E for the past few months and that they are taking credit for his job, OR that they wanted to fire him and created a secret conspiracy that worked on the 2nd Changeling in secret while lying him about accepting his work, knowing that they will replace it with their anyway.<br /> <br /> I always read it as &quot;There is no need to be worried, new team is composed out of experienced veterans who have worked on Changeling and CofD for months&quot;. So, uh. As in, &quot;they are not newbies, they have months of writing under their belt, both for CofD Core and Changeling line&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T13:42:53-07:00","id":1078509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spellfire22</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1077105-i-m-done?p=1078433#post1078433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To sue Onyx Path and/or White Wolf under a hostile work environment theory.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1077105-i-m-done?p=1078470#post1078470\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Who said he had any intent to do that?</div> </div> </div> </div>Going to court is not something that should be taken lightly. And in this case, probably not something worth doing. All the fees and costs associated with court is really expensive for all parties involved. Not just for David: OPP never struck me as the kind of company that could throw around that much money.<br /> <br /> Even if the allegations of David getting screwed out of his payment are true, I don't exactly think he would be missing out on payments in the hundreds of thousands of dollars. If anything, more money would be lost pursuing a court case instead of gaining money.<br /> <br /> So really, not much that can be realistically done but just walk away.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T14:44:39-07:00","id":1078542,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1077105-i-m-done?p=1077130#post1077130\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not to distract from this thread, but Shadowrun treats their freelancers pretty fucking awfully; there was a whole embezzling scandal that was never resolved, and the situation with pay was so bad that the Eclipse Phase people bought their own rights back from the main company in order to go independent.</div> </div> </div> </div>Someone pointed this thread out to me, so I just wanted to chime in to say that we didn't buy the Eclipse Phase rights back: we always owned Eclipse Phase, it was licensed to Catalyst, and they violated the licensing contract, so we exercised our right to nullify the contract.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13279-adamjury","name":"adamjury","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T14:56:26-07:00","id":1078553,"title":"","content":"Great cameo, and a reminder to not run wild with rumors.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T15:36:13-07:00","id":1078589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1077105-i-m-done?p=1078509#post1078509\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Going to court is not something that should be taken lightly. And in this case, probably not something worth doing. All the fees and costs associated with court is really expensive for all parties involved. Not just for David: OPP never struck me as the kind of company that could throw around that much money.<br /> <br /> Even if the allegations of David getting screwed out of his payment are true, I don't exactly think he would be missing out on payments in the hundreds of thousands of dollars. If anything, more money would be lost pursuing a court case instead of gaining money.<br /> <br /> So really, not much that can be realistically done but just walk away.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm so confused. Did I miss something? Since when was going to court ever an option on the table? Did David tweet about suing Onyx Path or something? Why are we discussing legal action in the first place?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","nam