er b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1077105-i-m-done?p=1078621#post1078621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You telling me that bad working conditions, in of itself and out of this context, doesn't warrant bringing up the possibility of taking things to court?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not really, if the aggrieved party hasn't expressed any interest or intent in doing so. Particularly if there isn't a case. It'd be another story if it was brought up as a suggestion, like, &quot;you know there's prob legal action he could take here.&quot; But saying &quot;I don't think he has a case&quot; is pretty irrelevant if he doesn't have interest in raising a case to begin with, and saying, &quot;don't rush into going to court lightly&quot; is pretty irrelevant if he wasn't planning to go to court, likely or otherwise. It's cautionary advice against a course of action that was never even under consideration.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T17:44:06-07:00","id":1078667,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1077105-i-m-done?p=1078626#post1078626\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not really, if the aggrieved party hasn't expressed any interest or intent in doing so. Particularly if there isn't a case. It'd be another story if it was brought up as a suggestion, like, &quot;you know there's prob legal action he could take here.&quot; But saying &quot;I don't think he has a case&quot; is pretty irrelevant if he doesn't have interest in raising a case to begin with, and saying, &quot;don't rush into going to court lightly&quot; is pretty irrelevant if he wasn't planning to go to court, likely or otherwise. It's cautionary advice against a course of action that was never even under consideration.</div> </div> </div> </div>I should note that I never believed legal action would be taken either. I not only think it would be highly unrealistic for anyone to do it, I think doing so would have made the situation worse.<br /> <br /> Doesn't mean there's absolutely no relation to the current situation at all.<br /> <br /> No, what would have been REALLY random is if Spellfire22 popped in here to just talk about how delicious cherry pies were and left it at that.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T19:02:39-07:00","id":1078702,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">\u200bI think this conversation has gone past where it needs to go. This thread has served its 